message: "If you use this software or reference this work, please cite the paper below."
title: "Bounded Agents: Delegation Security for Multi-Agent AI Systems"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and evaluation artifact for the Agentic Principal
  Chain (APC): a delegation-security model in which authority narrows
  monotonically at every hop and every proposed action must satisfy six
  conjunctive admissibility conditions evaluated over session history.
